  m_text: The police have identified a large-scale coining operation. They know the
    gangsters use cheap substances in the place of real silver coins. They are accusing
    a person called Johnny LeCriminal. They give you a sample of "silver" from coins
    that you suspect is theirs. Are these fake coins, and more importantly, can you
    exonerate or convict Johnny before his trial? Press G to grab the silver sample
    and R to release it into the test tube. To acquit/indict him, touch the telephone
    and then one of the options. Oh, and remember - silver compounds don't dissolve
    in water.
